# llms.txt — JSN (ServiceNow CLI)

name: JSN — ServiceNow CLI
author: Jace Benson
website: https://jsn.jace.pro
github: https://github.com/jacebenson/jsn

description:
JSN is an agent-native CLI for ServiceNow. It helps people and agents explore,
diagnose, change, and verify ServiceNow instances from a local terminal. It
supports records, relationships, catalog context, flows, diagnostics, ATF,
update sets, documentation search, and structured JSON output.

key_facts:
- Runs locally with npm; no hosted dashboard or MCP server is required
- Read-only workflows are supported and destructive changes require explicit intent
- 49,180 ServiceNow documents are searchable offline via `jsn docs`
- Agent skills install with `jsn skill install`

